#  patword_driver.icn -- the grading vehicle for procs/patword.icn: it links patword and exercises patword(s) on the
#  documented example "structural", words with repeated letters, all-distinct and all-same strings, non-letter
#  characters, a single character and the empty string.  Not exercised: the stop() paths (a word longer than 256
#  characters, more than 52 distinct characters), which terminate the program.
link patword
procedure main()
   every write(image(patword("structural" | "banana" | "mississippi" | "abcdef" | "zzzz" | "Aa1!Aa1!" | "x" | "" |
                              "the quick brown fox")))
end
